{"1827240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plague Lords: Witch Hunt", "steam_appid": 1827240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/0c4196220e9ea382cd4448d270c5bb5c.avif?t=1772533403\" width=636 height=244 /></span>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thirst for easy gain leads a small mercenary squad and their employer to a lost barony in the forest, plagued by a mysterious illness. It may be a new kind of the Black Death that has spread throughout medieval Europe or the machinations of local witches. A cunning dealer tries to exploit the tragedy for personal gain and traps the mercenaries in a dangerous game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/3df654c68626b67107a569a1a39b1110.avif?t=1772533403\" width=614 height=200 /></span>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prelude to the Plague Lords game will introduce you to the core mechanics and set the stage for the adventures that await you in Plague Lords. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the infected, explore lands shrouded in a mysterious epidemic, and try to uncover its secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/b58fdafd2ddbc4f5fd90376bdd608e72.poster.avif?t=1772533403\" width=614 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/b58fdafd2ddbc4f5fd90376bdd608e72.webm?t=1772533403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/b58fdafd2ddbc4f5fd90376bdd608e72.mp4?t=1772533403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/b82a588823ad19d0069fc39ebd612317.webp?t=1772533403\" width=615 height=20 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore one of the five main game cities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Command a small squad of trained soldiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build your own military camp with fortifications and crafting structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Utilize skills and constructions for three basic crafts out of the 12 in the main game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Construct, craft, and apply traps, barricades, and fortifications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a powerful arsenal with a small squad of experienced and well-armed mercenaries.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827240/extras/0c4196220e9ea382cd4448d270c5bb5c.avif?t=1772533403\" width=636 height=244 /></span>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thirst for easy gain leads a small mercenary squad and their employer to a lost barony in the forest, plagued by a mysterious illness. It may be a new kind of the Black Death that has spread throughout medieval Europe or the machinations of local witches. A cunning dealer tries to exploit the tragedy for personal gain and traps the mercenaries in a dangerous game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\